it in a different way.

00:07:41.400 --> 00:07:42.233
- Yeah.

00:07:42.233 --> 00:07:45.030
- How many mistakes can
I, what can I not do?

00:07:45.030 --> 00:07:47.580
What? Because I'm now
directing and writing and

00:07:47.580 --> 00:07:48.413
- Yeah.

00:07:48.413 --> 00:07:49.857
- Producing and
- That's so cool.

00:07:49.857 --> 00:07:51.660
- I'm learning from that.

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:53.370
I'm learning from watching

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:55.140
- Yeah.
- Your show with Bernie.

00:07:55.140 --> 00:07:55.973
- Yeah.

00:07:55.973 --> 00:07:58.950
