- It better not.

00:08:21.990 --> 00:08:23.190
Will you, will you correct me?

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:24.570
- No. That's for all of us, though.

00:08:24.570 --> 00:08:25.500
I hope that that never changes.

00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:27.150
I think that's when you die as an artist,

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:28.920
is when you stop learning.

00:08:28.920 --> 00:08:31.140
- B.B. King, he played
until he was 90 something.

00:08:31.140 --> 00:08:33.060
- Yeah.
- I hope to be,

00:08:33.060 --> 00:08:34.950
Betty White was me and Betty.

00:08:34.950 --> 00:08:35.850
You know, 99.

00:08:35.850 --> 00:08:38.340
I'm hoping to get to 105, at least.

00:08:38.340 --> 00:08:39.173
But it

00:08:40.800 --> 00:08:42.360
- I don't mind getting to 105

